From 54ef7f2ca636b83657506030e6bfbdc335f65bb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jitka=20Plesn=C3=ADkov=C3=A1?= <jplesnik@redhat.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Sep 2025 12:00:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Replace deprecated $function by new $action

The long-deprecated $function was removed from future SWIG 4.4.0.
It can be safely replaced by $action.

From SWIG 4.4.0 CHANGES:
  2025-06-09: olly
    The $function variable in %exception/feature:except typemaps is
    no longer recognised.  It was marked as deprecated in 2008.
    Use $action (added in 2001) instead which has exactly the same
    value.
---
 src/smartcard/scard/PcscTypemaps.i | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/smartcard/scard/PcscTypemaps.i b/src/smartcard/scard/PcscTypemaps.i
index c8d783e4..c90f1f47 100644
--- a/src/smartcard/scard/PcscTypemaps.i
+++ b/src/smartcard/scard/PcscTypemaps.i
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin St, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA  02110-1301  USA
 %exception
 {
     Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS;
-    $function
+    $action
     Py_END_ALLOW_THREADS;
 }
 
